

           Caesar Dip

      A very good reasonably healthy dip
      for vegies or fingers or whatever

      1 lb  creamy cottage cheese
      .5 c  grated parmeson cheese
      3 T   lemon juice
      1 T   worcestershire sauce
      1.5 t garlic salt (well...)
      1/2 t salt
      1/8 t black pepper
      1/2 t tobasco sauce
      1/2 t anchovy paste
      1/3 c olive oil

      puree everything but the oil in a 
      food processor, then drizzle in oil

